an>状態に入る。<br/><span style="color: #FFD780;">輝映・星電導</span>：<a href="#talent-11481-tooltip-11480001" data-link-token="N11480001" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity"><span style="color: #FFD780;">狩猟の印</span></a>を発動した時に獲得する<span style="color: #FFD780;">狩人の照準</span>の効果により、キャラクターがフィールド上にいる時に与える星電導ダメージがさらに+20%。<!----><!--]--></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!----> <!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="scroll-m-20 md:scroll-m-4" id="passive-1482301-tooltips"><div><summary class="text-sm font-semibold cursor-pointer select-none flex gap-2.5 items-center px-1.5 py-1.5 outline-none"><!--[-1--><svg width="25" height="26" viewBox="0 0 25 26" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="text-gi-electro size-6"><path d="M21.875 10.7354H14.8438V3.70416C14.8438 2.84137 14.144 2.14166 13.2812 2.14166H11.7188C10.856 2.14166 10.1562 2.84137 10.1562 3.70416V10.7354H3.125C2.26221 10.7354 1.5625 11.4351 1.5625 12.2979V13.8604C1.5625 14.7232 2.26221 15.4229 3.125 15.4229H10.1562V22.4542C10.1562 23.317 10.856 24.0167 11.7188 24.0167H13.2812C14.144 24.0167 14.8438 23.317 14.8438 22.4542V15.4229H21.875C22.7378 15.4229 23.4375 14.7232 23.4375 13.8604V12.2979C23.4375 11.4351 22.7378 10.7354 21.875 10.7354Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><!--]--> <span class="uppercase grow">Tooltips</span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></summary> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-2.5  bg-glass bg-border scroll-m-4" id="passive-1482501"><!--[0--><div class="flex items-stretch "><!--[-1--><!--]--> <h3 class="flex px-2.5 gap-2.5 bg-section-header grow min-w-0 items-stretch min-h-12 py-1 max-w-full"><div class="flex min-w-0 basis-0 grow self-stretch gap-2.5 items-center max-sm:w-full max-w-full"><!--[0--><!--[0--><div class="relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center h-10 min-w-10" style="aspect-ratio: 100/100"><!----><!--[0--><!--[0--><img alt="" cla