？いろんな犬種が揃ってるから、もしその気があれば言ってくれ。あんたなら、オレも安心して譲れる。<!----><!--]--></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></section><!----></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div> <!--[0--><div><summary class="text-sm font-semibold cursor-pointer select-none flex gap-2.5 items-center px-1.5 py-1.5 outline-none"><!--[-1--><svg width="25" height="26" viewBox="0 0 25 26" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="text-gi-electro size-6"><path d="M21.875 10.7354H14.8438V3.70416C14.8438 2.84137 14.144 2.14166 13.2812 2.14166H11.7188C10.856 2.14166 10.1562 2.84137 10.1562 3.70416V10.7354H3.125C2.26221 10.7354 1.5625 11.4351 1.5625 12.2979V13.8604C1.5625 14.7232 2.26221 15.4229 3.125 15.4229H10.1562V22.4542C10.1562 23.317 10.856 24.0167 11.7188 24.0167H13.2812C14.144 24.0167 14.8438 23.317 14.8438 22.4542V15.4229H21.875C22.7378 15.4229 23.4375 14.7232 23.4375 13.8604V12.2979C23.4375 11.4351 22.7378 10.7354 21.875 10.7354Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><!--]--> <span class="uppercase grow">See All Voicelines (67)</span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></summary> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!--]--><!----></div></section><!--]--><!----> <!--[0--><section class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 scroll-m-4" id="story"><h2 id="section_1146468134" class="w-full font-header flex flex-col gap-1  text-gi-electro scroll-m-20 md:scroll-m-4 group cursor-pointer"><div class="w-full flex justify-between items-end select-none"><span class="uppercase relative italic font-black text-2xl leading-6 pointer-events-none flex gap-2.5 items-center"><!---->Story<!----> <span class="inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="not-group-hover:opacity-0 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-100 pointer-events-none select-none"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 