6hoi7">x 1</span><!----></a><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--></section><!----></div><!--]--><!----></div></section><!--]--><!----> <!--[0--><section class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 scroll-m-4" id="dressing-room"><h2 id="section_3359434529" class="w-full font-header flex flex-col gap-1  text-gi-electro scroll-m-20 md:scroll-m-4 group cursor-pointer"><div class="w-full flex justify-between items-end select-none"><span class="uppercase relative italic font-black text-2xl leading-6 pointer-events-none flex gap-2.5 items-center"><!---->Dressing Room<!----> <span class="inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="not-group-hover:opacity-0 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-100 pointer-events-none select-none"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><!----></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <div class="bg-gi-electro text-section-body h-0.75 w-full"></div></h2><!----> <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 py-2.5"><div class="flex gap-2.5 justify-center flex-wrap w-full"><!--[0--><div class="inline-flex w-fit min-w-64 text-sm bg-section-header rounded-[10px] text-center flex-col"><div class="h-56 min-w-64 w-fit"><!----><!--[0--><!--[0--><img alt="狩りの冬衣" class="h-56 min-w-64 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity svelte-sapi7u" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://i.gachabase.net/B1cOsfp4Q8I3KzzPcdxoDWXZMcmg_SwYjRT3YXvA18A/q:50/f:webp/plain/gi/assets/3a8a6294f85adae4047290b84a5bfd74.png" style="aspect-ratio: 2048/1024; aspect-ratio: 2048/1024;" data-preview-src="https://cdn.gachabase.net/gi/assets/3a8a6294f85adae4047290b84a5bfd74.png" data-preview-alt="狩りの冬衣" data-preview-download="https://cdn.gachabase.net/gi/assets/3a8a6294f85adae4047290b84a5bfd74.png" data-preview-thumbnail="https://i.gachabase.net/B1cOsfp4Q8I3KzzPcdxoDWXZMcmg_SwYjRT3YXvA18A/q:50/f:webp/plain/gi/assets/3a8a6294f85adae4047290b84a5bfd74.png" onload="this.__e=event" onerror="this.__e=event"/> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----><!----></div> <div class="w-0 min-w-full wrap-break-word p-1.25 font-header font-semibold bg-gi-electro text-section-body">狩りの冬衣</div> <div class="w-0 min-w-full wrap-break-word p-1.25 font-header font-semibold bg-black text-white">Default Skin</div> <!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text w-0 min-w-full wrap-break-word p-2.5"><!--[0--><!---->アリョーシャの衣装。耐久性に優れた狩猟服で、分厚い裏地とふわふわのフードの縁が付いており、これによりアリョーシャは目当ての獲物を仕留めるまで長時間雪の中に潜伏することができる。フードが子犬の頭のデザインを模しているのは、見た目がかわいくてトゥガリンも気に入っているからだ。<!----><!--]--></span> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--> <!--[--><!--]--></div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><!--[--><!--]--></div><!----></div></section><!--]--><!----><!----></article><!----><!----><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!----><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!----></main> <!--[0--><div class="site-banner-toggled opacity-100 duration-300 transition-opacity fixed bg-splash-primary text-black w-full max-w-[100cqw] overflow-hidden h-12 max-md:mt-16 flex items-center order-1 z-80"><div class="select-none pointer-events-none"><!--[-1--><div class="flex relative whitespace-nowrap scroll-overflow-infinite select-none svelte-46oqk" style="width: 50px;; animation-duration: 1s;"><div class="px-1 svelte-46oqk"><!--[-1--><!--[0--><!--[0--><!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text mx-3"><!---->You are now viewing <span class="gb-bold">アリョーシャ</span> on <span class="gb-bold">v7.0.53 Rev. D47931186 A47882239 (Beta)</span><!----></span><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----><!--]--></div> <!--[0--><!--[--><div class="px-1 svelte-46oqk"><!--[-1--><!--[0--><!--[0--><!--[0--><span class="gb-wrap-text mx-3"><!---->You are n